      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDng are delighted to present this charming two-bedroom property offers comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation, with a spacious open-plan kitchen, living and dining area providing an ideal space for modern living.\n\nThe property comprises two bedrooms and one bathroom, with an electric shower. Features include solid timber flooring throughout, dual heating, and an oil-fired central heating (OFCH) system.\n\nThe property also benefits from a stove, a fuel shed, and a rear entrance providing additional access and convenience.\n\nViewing highly recommened but strictly through auctioneer."
